exports[`the scene proposals-prose draws as it was drawn by hand 1`] = `
"label width 2
  LINES run 1
    "1" none none: "Moving the workshop"
    "2" none none: 
    "3" none none: "The lease on the old place runs out at the end of March, and the new one"
    "4" none none: "is ready from the second week of February, so there's a month of overlap"
    "5" none none: "to move in without stopping work."
    "6" none none: 
    "7" none none: "What goes first:"
    "8" none none: "    - the lathe and the drill press, which need the van and two people"
    "9" none none: "    - the timber rack, taken down and rebuilt on the far wall"
    "10" none none: "    - the hand tools, last, so the bench keeps working until the end"
    "11" none none: 
    "12" none none: "What stays:"
    "13" none none: "    - the old dust extractor, which the landlord has agreed to keep"
    "14" none none: "    - the shelving by the door, which was there when we came"
    "15" none none: "    - the sink, which is plumbed in"
    "16" none none: 
    "17" none none: "Costs, roughly:"
    "18" none none: "\\tvan hire\\ttwo days"
    "19" none none: "\\telectrician\\thalf a day, for the three-phase supply"
    "20" none none: "\\tpaint\\t\\twhatever's left over from the house"
    "21" none none: 
FRAME 22-22
  CURRENT_LINES run 2
    "22" changed none: "The one thing that " "can't slip"{data-change=restyled data-side=before data-source=bold data-state=OPEN} " is the electrician" ", because without the three-phase supply the lathe can't run"{data-change=removed data-side=before data-source=reason data-state=OPEN} ", and without the lathe " "half"{data-change=replaced data-side=before data-source=most data-state=OPEN} " the orders on the board can't be " "finished"{data-change=replaced data-side=before data-source=most data-state=OPEN} "; everything else can move " "a week"{data-change=replacedRestyled data-side=before data-source=weeks data-state=OPEN} " either way without anyone noticing."
